{"title": "法融一系的禅心与文佛", "index": 1079, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"CJCTU0-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<h2 class=\"kindle-cn-heading3\" id=\"calibre_pb_6\"><a class=\"calibre23\" id=\"sec005\"></a>法融一系的禅心与文佛索引表</h2>\n<h5 class=\"calibre29\">（初稿一）</h5>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone9\" src=\"../images/00489.jpeg\"/> <img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone9\" src=\"../images/00490.jpeg\"/></div>\n<h5 class=\"calibre29\">（初稿二）</h5>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"kindle-cn-table-body1\">\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\" colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">智严禅师下旁出八人</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">法号</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">弘法之地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">镜潭禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">东都（洛阳）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">志长禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">襄州（湖北襄阳）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">义真禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">湖州（浙江）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">端伏禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">益州（四川）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">龟仁禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">龙光（未详）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">辩才禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">襄州（湖北襄阳）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">法俊禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">汉南（湖北南部）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">敏右禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">西川（四川成都）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\" colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">法持禅师下旁出二人</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">玄素禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">牛头山（金陵）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">弘仁禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">天柱（未详）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\" colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">玄素禅师下旁出二人</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">昙益禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">金华（浙江金华）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">圆镜禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">吴门（江苏吴县）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\" colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">道钦禅师复出三人</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">山悟禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">木渚（未详）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">广敷禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">青阳（安徽贵池）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">中子禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">杭州</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\" colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">道林禅师复出一人</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">宝观禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">灵岩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\" colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-bold\">法融禅师下三世一十二人，只有昙璀禅师见录，其他十一人则不录</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-table-body\">\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg2\">昙璀禅师</td>\n<td class=\"kindle-cn-table-dg3\">金陵钟山</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"kindle-cn-tabl